<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - L.M. Ericsson raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - L.M. Ericsson raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised its recommendation on Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The Nasdaq-traded American Depositary Receipts rose 5/8 to 25, approaching a year-high 25-5/8.</p>
</text>
